---
import SEOHead from '../../components/SEOHead.astro';

const title = "Refund Policy — GridPaw Ad-Free Purchase";
const description = "GridPaw refund policy for the one-time ad-free unlock: 7 days, no questions asked. How to request a refund, what it covers, and how long it takes.";
const updated = "2026-11-07";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <SEOHead title={title} description={description} canonical="/refund-policy/" type="article" noindex={true} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://gridpaw.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Refund Policy", "item": "https://gridpaw.com/refund-policy/" }
    ]
  })} />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: <time datetime={updated}>{updated}</time></p>

    <h2>What we sell</h2>
    <p>GridPaw sells a single one-time product, <strong>Ad-Free (lifetime)</strong>. It hides the advertising slots on gridpaw.com on any device where you restore it with the email you paid with. It is not a subscription: there are no renewals and no recurring charges.</p>

    <h2>7-day, no-questions refund</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@gridpaw.com">support@gridpaw.com</a> within <strong>7 days</strong> of purchase with the email address or receipt you paid with, and we refund in full. You do not need to give a reason.</p>
    <p>We refund to the original payment method through Stripe. Refunds typically appear within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank or card issuer.</p>

    <h2>What happens to the unlock after a refund</h2>
    <p>When a payment is refunded, the ad-free unlock for that order is revoked and ads return on your next page load. Nothing else on your account is affected — your progress and puzzle data stay as they are.</p>

    <h2>EU / UK customers</h2>
    <p>Digital content is normally exempt from the 14-day right of withdrawal once delivery has begun. We deliberately waive that exception: you get the 7-day no-questions refund above regardless of where you live, and it is at least as generous as the statutory minimum for this product.</p>

    <h2>If something does not work</h2>
    <p>If the unlock does not appear after payment, do not buy it a second time. Email us with your receipt and we will either fix the delivery or refund you — whichever you prefer.</p>

    <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
    <p>Please contact us before starting a chargeback with your bank. A chargeback costs far more than the product and is much slower for you; a refund email resolves it the same day.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Refunds and billing questions: <a href="mailto:support@gridpaw.com">support@gridpaw.com</a>. See also our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </main>

  <style>
    :root { --amber: #D97706; --cream: #FFFBF5; --text: #3A2F28; --muted: #9C8B7B; --border: #F2E4D4; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--text); }
    .legal { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 80px; }
    h1 { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .updated { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
    h2 { font-size: 17px; margin: 28px 0 8px; }
    p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4A3F36; margin: 0 0 10px; }
    a { color: var(--amber); }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
